    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "San Pranciseo, July 15, 1927.\nMr. A. Toziggino,\nMills Building,\nSan Francisco.\nDear Mr. Torigino:\nThis letter is written to assure you that the\nCity and County of San Prancisco is toking steps to\nprotect the Mills Estate from sny damage that might\nbe incurred incidental to the construction end use\nof the proposed emergency runway, loceted west of the\nBay Shore Highwey on the Mills Estate property.\nPending drawing up the necessery papers,\nI will greatly appreciate your giving permission at\nthis time for the City to construot such \u0026 runway\nat once.\nYours very truly,\nMilo Kent\nChairman of Airport Committee,\nBosrd of Supervisors,\nCity and County of San Irancisco.\nGDB /KS\n-rro, 810\n- 000?"
